WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.205
Start a new empty notebook. (3× speed)

00:00:00.205 --> 00:00:00.490
Upload the workshop book as the source. (3× speed)

00:00:00.490 --> 00:00:00.701
The workshop book is being indexed. (3× speed)

00:00:00.701 --> 00:00:01.024
Widen the flashcard request. (3× speed)

00:00:01.024 --> 00:00:03.480
Write the source-grounded request. (3× speed)

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:05.585
Read the complete request.

00:00:05.585 --> 00:00:05.848
Send the question with the selected book. (3× speed)

00:00:05.848 --> 00:00:05.869
Generate the answer from the selected source. (4× speed)

00:00:05.869 --> 00:00:06.588
The first app is still loading; inspect the native Flashcards configuration. (3× speed)

00:00:06.588 --> 00:00:06.891
Configure flashcards with the actual Studio Flashcards tool. (3× speed)

00:00:06.891 --> 00:00:09.330
Choose fewer text-only cards from the selected book. (3× speed)

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:11.602
Read the complete flashcard topic.

00:00:11.602 --> 00:00:11.809
Generate native flashcards from the selected book. (3× speed)

00:00:11.809 --> 00:00:11.854
Generate the source-grounded native flashcard deck. (4× speed)

00:00:11.854 --> 00:00:14.281
Recall the difference between training and inference.

00:00:14.281 --> 00:00:18.399
Reveal training versus inference

00:00:18.399 --> 00:00:18.656
Mark a difficult answer, then try another example.

00:00:18.656 --> 00:00:21.661
Mark the first answer for practice

00:00:21.661 --> 00:00:25.932
Reveal what a definition changes

00:00:25.932 --> 00:00:29.211
Mark the second answer as understood

00:00:29.211 --> 00:00:33.434
Compare training with a new prompt

00:00:33.434 --> 00:00:35.878
Mark the third answer as understood

00:00:35.878 --> 00:00:36.098
Return to the difficult card and try it again.

00:00:36.098 --> 00:00:41.732
Return to the earlier question

00:00:41.732 --> 00:00:46.024
Check the difficult answer again

00:00:46.024 --> 00:00:49.133
Mark the answer after another attempt
